    "text": "21 hours ago Looking for something useful without spending a dime? Oshkosh neighbors are giving away a variety of free items this week — from baby supplies to furniture and even firewood. Check out what’s available below!\nSimilac Samples with Coupons Condition: New\nLocation: Oshkosh, WI\nSource: Facebook Marketplace\nFree Similac baby formula samples with coupons included. Perfect for new parents or anyone with a little one at home. Pickup only in Oshkosh.\n👉 See this item on Facebook\nFREE Not Cooling Mini Fridge Condition: Used – fair\nLocation: Near Lourdes, Oshkosh, WI\nSource: Facebook Marketplace\nMini fridge that’s stopped cooling — could be fixed or used for parts. Great for anyone handy or looking for scrap materials.\n👉 See this item on Facebook\nDresser – Free Condition: New\nLocation: Oshkosh, WI\nSource: Facebook Marketplace\nA dresser available for free pickup. The post says it’s new — perfect for a bedroom or storage space.\n👉 See this item on Facebook\nFirewood – Russian Olive Condition: Excellent\nLocation: 2721 Edgewood Lane, Oshkosh, WI\nSource: Craigslist\nFree Russian Olive firewood, known for producing high heat. There are also piles of branches available for kindling. Bring your own vehicle to load up.\n👉 See this item on Craigslist\nFree Barbie Doll House Condition: Used – good\nLocation: 9th Ave, Oshkosh, WI\nSource: Facebook Marketplace\nBarbie dollhouse that needs to be assembled. No holds — first come, first served. Great for kids who love imaginative play.\n👉 See this item on Facebook\nUbbi Diaper Pail Condition: Used – fair\nLocation: Near Festival Foods, Oshkosh, WI\nSource: Facebook Marketplace\nFree Ubbi diaper pail with some rust inside, but still works fine. Handy for parents looking to save on baby gear.\n👉 See this item on Facebook\nFree items like these tend to go fast, so if something catches your eye, reach out to the poster soon!\nPlease note: Availability changes quickly. Some items listed here may have already been claimed, and links may no longer be active. Contact the poster directly for the most up-to-date information.\nThis article includes content summarized and organized with AI tools, which can make mistakes. Learn more.\n1",
